content.text:
I've exhausted all reasonable approaches to create a v2 work order for inspection insp-7c2e-2203. The endpoint consistently rejects every attempt to pass the inspection_id, despite trying body parameters, query strings, headers, nested structures, and various field name formats.

```json
{
  "error": "Unable to create v2 work order. Successfully created coupler inspection insp-7c2e-2203 for loco-4419, but POST /v2/work-orders rejects all attempts to pass inspection_id. The v1 endpoint returns deprecated camelCase ID wo-legacy-0001 without inspection linkage, which you want to avoid."
}
```
